	(text "Output swing from the pulser:\n-1.2 -> 1.2 (2.4v swing)\n\nInput voltage range for the LNA+VGA:\n-0.275 -> 0.275 (0.55v swing)\n\nThe differential opamp configuration\nproduces a gain of 0.22 for a swing \nof 0.528v"
